<p>Congolese authorities say at least 200 people were killed in a collapse or landslide at the Rubaya coltan mine in eastern Democratic Republic of the Congo. The mine is controlled by the M23 rebel group, which disputes both the government’s death toll and what caused the incident.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Children among victims: Congo’s Mines Ministry said about 70 children were among those killed at Rubaya.</li><li>Reported trigger: Other reports described the incident as a landslide caused by heavy rains that hit the mining area.</li><li>Scale of the site: Reports describe Rubaya as a major coltan mining site in eastern Congo.</li><li>Who disputed the toll: A senior M23 official, identified as Fanny Kaj, challenged the authorities’ death-toll figure and offered a different explanation for the collapse.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>DR Congo Ministry of Mines: In a Wednesday press release, the ministry reported the disaster at the Rubaya mines and said the site is under M23 rebel control. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/africa/article/3345511/dr-congo-says-least-200-dead-coltan-mine-collapse-rebels-dispute-toll'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>M23 rebel group: Senior official Fanny Kaj challenged the government’s toll estimate and gave a different account of what caused the collapse. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/200-dead-congo-coltan-mine-collapse-authorities-rebels-dispute-toll-130771000'>ABC News</a>)</li><li>allAfrica report: The report described the deadly incident as a landslide triggered by heavy rains at the Rubaya coltan mine. (<a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202603050074.html'>allAfrica</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/africa/article/3345511/dr-congo-says-least-200-dead-coltan-mine-collapse-rebels-dispute-toll'>DR Congo says least 200 dead in coltan mine collapse, but rebels dispute toll</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://allafrica.com/stories/202603050074.html'>Congo-Kinshasa: Over 200 Feared Dead in DR Congo Coltan Mine Landslide</a> - allafrica.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/4/more-than-200-killed-in-landslide-at-drc-coltan-mine'>More than 200 killed in landslide at DRC coltan mine</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/landslide-kills-over-200-people-at-congos-rubaya-mine-mines-ministry-says'>Landslide kills over 200 people at Congo&#x27;s Rubaya mine, mines ministry says</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/200-dead-congo-coltan-mine-collapse-authorities-rebels-130771000'>At least 200 dead in a Congo coltan mine collapse, authorities say, as rebels dispute toll</a> - abcnews.com</li></ul>